      "statement": "CORS is configured with allow_origins=[\"*\"], allow_credentials=True, allow_methods=[\"*\"], and allow_headers=[\"*\"], meaning the API accepts cross-origin requests from any origin, relying on bearer-token authentication rather than origin restriction for protection.",
